# Mnemosyne — Cursor Rules

**Read [`CLAUDE.md`](../../CLAUDE.md) before editing any code.** It is the canonical guide with verified facts about primitives, verbs, security invariants, and CI commands.

**Check [`docs/STATUS.md`](../../docs/STATUS.md)** for what is actually implemented vs. stubbed.

